on"],[1773,"**Home**"],[1904,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1893,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[2083,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[2074,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[735,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[775,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1867,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[333,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[332,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1896,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[864,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1792,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1929,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[771,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1891,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[788,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1895,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1662,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[782,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1166,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[704,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[769,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[786,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[779,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1211,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1210,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[866,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1378,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[2111,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[770,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[765,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1865,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1902,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1794,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1870,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1900,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1897,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1337,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1338,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1427,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[338,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1931,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1863,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1373,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[862,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[530,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1664,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[1015,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1376,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1771,"**Space / Enter**"],[1216,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[337,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[910,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1341,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[764,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM